# Route: guide 51 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 13 quests, 1.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Swamp of Sorrows, Redridge Mountains, Burning Steppes, Badlands,
# Durotar, Orgrimmar, Western Plaguelands): Stagalbog -> Stonard ->
# Splinterspear Junction -> Lakeshire -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Dreadmaul Rock
# -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> Thunder Ridge -> The
# Writhing Haunt.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Necklace Recovery (2283;
# Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger
# 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave
# Hunter 36-37).
#
# Left out: Gahrron's Withering Cauldron (5227): the route takes them here but
# cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024),
# Precarious Predicament (4121), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Egg
# Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Find the Gems and Power Source
# (2339), Disharmony of Fire (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of
# the Machines (4063), KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT:
# High Ranking Dark Iron Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge
# (4132), Lost Thunderbrew Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack
